resources.string:
• Android 2.3 and 4.0–4.4: main support; 5.x–6.x: experimental.
• 32-bit ARM firmware only (armeabi / armeabi-v7a).

Formats:
• CWM/TWRP recovery ZIP (MIUI, CyanogenMod, ports, most custom ROMs);
• Samsung: Odin .tar / .tar.md5 or a ZIP with AP_*.tar.md5;
• Google factory images (.tgz / .zip);
• system.img (ext4, sparse, YAFFS2), TWRP backup system.ext4.win;
• OTA with system.new.dat(.br) + system.transfer.list.

Best if the archive contains boot.img: the service start order is taken from it.
